" value="&lt;b&gt;Room schedule – carpet area&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;table border=&quot;1&quot; cellpadding=&quot;3&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px;width:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background-color:#E8EEF7;&quot;&gt;&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Room&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Clear size&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;sq ft&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;BEDROOM 3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;12′-4″ × 12′-0″ + 4′-4″ × 4′-8″&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;168&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;BATH 3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;4′-0″ × 7′-0″&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;28&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;BEDROOM 2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;12′-10″ × 12′-0″&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;154&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;DINING&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;16′-2″ × 12′-0″&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;194&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;LOBBY&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;4′-10″ × 4′-8″&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;23&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;KITCHEN&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;8′-6″ × 12′-0″&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;102&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;BATH 2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;4′-6″ × 7′-0″&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;31&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;MASTER SUITE&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;11′-8″ × 14′-5″&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;168&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;BATH 1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;4′-0″ × 7′-6″&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;30&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;DRESSING&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;4′-0″ × 6′-6″&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;26&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;LIVING&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;16′-0″ × 10′-0″&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;160&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Total (excl. balcony)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;1083&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;rounded=0;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1F2D3D;" vertex="1" parent="E2-notes"><mxGeometry x="230.00" y="1110.00" width="640.00" height="560.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Option E2 – as E1, but the back strip becomes part of the master suite&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Back 4′ strip enclosed&lt;/b&gt; ③: a 10″ wall and windows at the slab edge replace the balcony parapet. &lt;b&gt;No balcony&lt;/b&gt;. The master suite = bedroom 168 sq ft + bath + dressing room.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;One entrance&lt;/b&gt; ① and &lt;b&gt;one kitchen&lt;/b&gt; ⑤ (102 sq ft, west end) exactly as E1; Bath 2 between kitchen and dining via the lobby ④.&lt;br&gt;• The old master (NW) becomes Bedroom 3 with its attached bath; Bedroom 2 stays in the middle.&lt;br&gt;• 1083 sq ft carpet, no balcony. Master suite 223 sq ft (bedroom 168 + bath 30 + dressing 26) against 155 sq ft for E1's NE bedroom + bath.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Reading this plan&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;① entrance · ② existing stair (assumed) · ③ enclosed back strip, windows on the north wall · ④ lobby · ⑤ kitchen · ⑥ wide opening in the C-line wall.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Engineer to confirm&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• The back strip is a 4′ cantilever: closing it adds wall + glazing load at the tip. Check the slab edge / beam and the bye-law (FAR, setback) for enclosing it.&lt;br&gt;• C2–C3 opening needs a beam above; cantilever, waterproofing and bye-law points as plan A.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Colours&lt;/b&gt; – blue = bedrooms · peach = living / dining · yellow = kitchen · grey-blue = baths · green = balcony." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;rounded=0;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1F2D3D;" vertex="1" parent="E2-notes"><mxGeometry x="920.00" y="1110.00" width="800.00" height="560.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="E3" name="E3 · Full 3 BHK (central spine)"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="12" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1900" pageHeight="1750" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="E3-floor" value="Floor tints (locked)" style="locked=1;" parent="0"/><mxCell id="E3-struct" value="Structure – pillars (locked) + walls" parent="0"/><mxCell id="E3-open" value="Doors &amp; windows" parent="0"/><mxCell id="E3-furn" value="Furniture &amp; fixtures (indicative)" parent="0"/><mxCell id="E3-label" value="Room labels" parent="0"/><mxCell id="E3-dims" value="Dimensions &amp; grid" parent="0"/><mxCell id="E3-notes" value="Title, legend, schedule, notes" parent="0"/><mxCell id="tint-MBR-0" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#E3EEF9;" vertex="1" parent="E3-floor"><mxGeometry x="350.50" y="240.00" width="305.50" height="307.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tint-MBR-1" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#E3EEF9;" vertex="1" parent="E3-floor"><mxGeometry x="240.00" y="422.50" width="115.00" height="124.50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tint-BATH1-0" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#E6ECF1;" vertex="1" parent="E3-floor"><mxGeometry x="240.00" y="240.00" width="110.50" height="182.50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tint-BR2-0" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#E3EEF9;" vertex="1" parent="E3-floor"><mxGeometry x="374.50" y="547.00" width="281.50" height="307.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tint-BR2-1" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#E3EEF9;" vertex="1" parent="E3-floor"><mxGeometry x="240.00" y="547.00" width="139.00" height="133.50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tint-BATH2-