schedule – carpet area&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;table border=&quot;1&quot; cellpadding=&quot;3&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px;width:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background-color:#E8EEF7;&quot;&gt;&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Room&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Clear size&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;sq ft&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;MASTER BEDROOM&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;12′-2″ × 12′-0″ + 4′-4″ × 4′-8″&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;166&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;BATH 1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;4′-0″ × 7′-0″&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;28&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;BEDROOM 2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;11′-2″ × 12′-0″ + 5′-4″ × 5′-0″&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;160&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;BATH 2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;5′-0″ × 6′-8″&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;33&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;KITCHEN&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;12′-7″ × 7′-7″&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;95&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;GUEST WC&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;4′-0″ × 5′-6″&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;22&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;DINING HALL&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;12′-7″ × 16′-10″ overall (L-shaped)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;186&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;BEDROOM 3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;11′-8″ × 10′-0″ + 4′-4″ × 2′-4″&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;126&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;BATH 3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;4′-0″ × 7′-4″&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;29&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;BALCONY&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;16′-0″ × 3′-10″&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;61&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;LIVING&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;16′-0″ × 10′-0″&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;160&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Total (excl. balcony)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;1005&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;rounded=0;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1F2D3D;" vertex="1" parent="E3-notes"><mxGeometry x="230.00" y="1110.00" width="640.00" height="560.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Option E3 – kitchen and dining in the central B–C bay, en-suite bedrooms on both sides&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;One entrance&lt;/b&gt; ① beside the stair. &lt;b&gt;One kitchen&lt;/b&gt; ④ across the back of the central bay (95 sq ft), window on the north (non-highway) wall.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Dining hall&lt;/b&gt; ⑤ (186 sq ft) is the hub: master, Bedroom 2, kitchen, guest WC and the opening ⑥ to the living all open onto it. No lobby and no passage.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;West wing&lt;/b&gt; (A–B bay): master (attached Bath 1) and Bedroom 2 (attached Bath 2) – doors in the B-line wall. &lt;b&gt;East wing&lt;/b&gt; (C–D bay): Bedroom 3 with attached Bath 3 and balcony ③, living and entrance.&lt;br&gt;• 1005 sq ft carpet + 61 sq ft balcony; four wet rooms (3 en-suite + guest WC) – the most plumbing of the options.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Reading this plan&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;① entrance · ② existing stair (assumed) · ③ balcony · ④ kitchen · ⑤ dining hall · ⑥ 9′-9″ opening in the C-line wall between hall and living.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Rules kept&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Left 4′ strip = baths, bedroom windows and the master niche only – no balcony. Every pillar sits inside a wall (B1–B3 inside the B-line wall).&lt;br&gt;• Attached baths open only into their bedroom; the guest WC opens onto the hall; every habitable room has an external window.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Colours&lt;/b&gt; – blue = bedrooms · peach = living / dining · yellow = kitchen · grey-blue = baths · green = balcony.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Engineer to confirm&lt;/b&gt; – C2–C3 opening needs a beam above; cantilever, waterproofing and bye-law points as plan A." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;rounded=0;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1F2D3D;" vertex="1" parent="E3-notes"><mxGeometry x="920.00" y="1110.00" width="800.00" height="560.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="compare" name="Compare options"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="12" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1900" pageHeight="1000" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="compare-notes" value="Comparison" parent="0"/><mxCell id="title" value="First-floor options – side by side (plan A stays untouched in first-floor-plan.drawio)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;rounded=0;fontSize=24;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1F2D3D;" vertex="1" parent="compare-notes"><mxGeometry x="60.00" y="20.00" width="1700.00" height="34.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="subtitle" value="Same 12 locked pillars and 48′ × 30′ roof in every option · left 4′ strip = baths / kitchen / windows only · 4′ front gallery · stair assumed at D3 · carpet areas exclude balcony and walls" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;rounded=0;fontSize=13;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="compare-notes"><mxGeometry x="60.00" y="56.00" width="1780.00" height="22.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="compare-table" value="&lt;table border=&quot;1&quot; cellpadding=&quot;6&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px;width:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background-color:#E8EEF7;&quot;&gt;&lt;th align='left'&gt;Option&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th align='left'&gt;Where&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th align='left'&gt;Idea&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th align='left'&gt;Homes&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th align='left'&gt;Carpet sq ft&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th align='left'&gt;Kitchen sq ft&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th align='left'&gt;Passage / lobby&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th align='left'&gt;Entrance doors&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th align='left'&gt;Baths&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th align='left'&gt;Balcony sq ft&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th align='left'&gt;Watch out for&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background-color:#F4F4F4;&quot;&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;A (existing)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;first-floor-plan.drawio&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;2 BHK west, 1 BHK east; Bath 2 reached through a 3′-6″ passage&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1 BHK + 2 BHK → 3 BHK&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;698 + 311 = 1,009&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;66 (2 BHK) · 61 (1 BHK)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;45 sq ft passage&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;61&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;The red passage is under-used; the TV unit stands in front of the 1 BHK bedroom door&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background-color:#FFFFFF;&quot;&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;C&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;pages 1–2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Plan A with the passage removed: kitchen at the west end, Bath 2 between kitchen and living/dining, 2 BHK west, 1 BHK east&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1 BHK + 2 BHK → 3 BHK&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;700 + 311 = 1,011&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;102 (2 BHK) · 61 (1 BHK)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;23 sq ft lobby, part of the dining floor&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;61&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Kitchen window on the highway wall&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background-color:#FFFFFF;&quot;&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;D&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;pages 3–4&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1 BHK on the west (far from the stair), 2 BHK east next to the stair; party wall on the B line&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1 BHK + 2 BHK → 3 BHK&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;387 + 614 = 1,001&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;72 (1 BHK) · 61 (2 BHK)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;none&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;61 (2 BHK only)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;2 BHK shrinks to 614 sq ft, master only 8′-2″ wide; 1 BHK has no balcony&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background-color:#FFFFFF;&quot;&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;E1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;page 5&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;One 3 BHK: kitchen at the west end, Bath 2 between kitchen and dining, living at the entrance, 3 bedrooms along the back&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;3 BHK&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1,015&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;102&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;23 sq ft lobby&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;61&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Third bedroom is the smallest (11′-8″ × 10′-0″)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background-color:#FFFFFF;&quot;&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;E2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;page 6&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;E1 with the back strip enclosed: master suite (bedroom + bath + dressing room) in the NE&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;3 BHK&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1,083&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;102&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;23 sq ft lobby&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;none&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Encloses a 4′ cantilever – needs structural OK and a bye-law check (FAR / setback)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background-color:#FFFFFF;&quot;&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;E3&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;page 7&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Kitchen across the back of the central B–C bay, dining hall as hub, 3 en-suite bedrooms + guest WC&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;3 BHK&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1,005&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;95&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;none&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;4 (3 en-suite + guest WC)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;61&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Four wet rooms (3 baths + guest WC); L-shaped hall (186 sq ft); long galley kitchen 12′-7″ × 7′-7″&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;rounded=0;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2D3D;" vertex="1" parent="compare-notes"><mxGeometry x="60.00" y="100.00" width="1780.00" height="420.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="compare-picks" value="&lt;b&gt;How to choose&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Keep two homes and fix the passage → &lt;b&gt;C&lt;/b&gt; (same split as A, kitchen at the end, Bath 2 between kitchen and living – exactly your first suggestion).&lt;br&gt;• 1 BHK far from the stair and the 2 BHK next to it → &lt;b&gt;D&lt;/b&gt; (your second suggestion). The 2 BHK gets tighter.&lt;br&gt;• One family, one kitchen, one entrance → &lt;b&gt;E1&lt;/b&gt; (balcony kept), &lt;b&gt;E2&lt;/b&gt; (biggest master, no balcony, structural check) or &lt;b&gt;E3&lt;/b&gt; (central kitchen–dining spine, 3 en-suite).&lt;br&gt;• Pages 1, 3 and the E pages show the home(s) as built; pages 2 and 4 show the same plan with the connecting door open as one 3 BHK.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Common to all options&lt;/b&gt; – 10″ external / party walls flush with the pillar faces, 4½″ partitions, every pillar inside a wall, every habitable room has an external window, no balcony on the highway strip, entrance doors swing inward. Furniture is indicative. Model checks run on every page: door swings, clear zone in front of every door, furniture clashes, bath access, one entrance / one kitchen on E pages." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;rounded=0;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2D3D;" vertex="1" parent="compare-notes"><mxGeometry x="60.00" y="540.00" width="1780.00" height="260.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>